  "body": "## What fails\n\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets` (and the debug test build) on upstream/main `3701b32d8`:\n\n```\nerror[E0063]: missing field `body` in initializer of `camcraft_app::fixture_locate::LocateSpec`\n   --> crates/app/tests/stock_in_vise_sim.rs:103:16\n```\n\n## Cause\n\nTwo PRs that each built alone, merged one after the other without a combined test:\n- PR #2184 (`4bb520b75`) added the required field `LocateSpec::body`.\n- PR #2182 (`61dc27ddf`) added `crates/app/tests/stock_in_vise_sim.rs` with a `LocateSpec` literal of the old shape.\n\nmkinney's merge train found this clash before the merge (main + #2184 + #2182 did not compile) and held #2182 back. Test code only; product code builds. Found by the hourly main health check.\n\n## Fix\n\nGive the literal at `crates/app/tests/stock_in_vise_sim.rs:103` its `body` value (the value that the other `LocateSpec` literals in `crates/app/tests/` use for the plain case).\n\nDone means: the all-targets clippy and `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test stock_in_vise_sim` are green on main.\n",
